 "producer": "scalesmear 1.1.0",
 "description": "Per-track momentum scale and extra resolution for MC, fitted to the Ds -> phi(KK) pi mass peak in data.",
 "apply_to": "MC only, every charged track used in the analysis (kaons, pion, muon). Data are not corrected.",
 "formula": "pT' = pT / [ (1 + A - e/pT + q*M*pT) * (1 + sqrt(max(a2 + c2*pT^2, 0)) * z) ]; equivalently k' = k (1 + A - e*k + q*M/k)(1 + sqrt(a^2 + c^2/k^2) z) with k = 1/pT; direction unchanged",
 "reference": "CMS W-mass measurement, arXiv:2412.13872, Eqs. 2-3 (A, epsilon, M; a, c). (A, e, M) give data relative to MC; (a, c) the resolution MC is missing. CMS's b, d term is not used.",
 "variables": {
